#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_send_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"\"%(tmpl)s\" requires an NDA, but the \"%(brand)s\" brand has none uploaded. The requirement is removed.\n"
"\n"
"Upload the NDA on the brand (Settings › Brands), or choose a brand that has one."
msgstr ""
"« %(tmpl)s » exige une entente de confidentialité, mais la marque « %(brand)s » n'en a aucune de téléversée. L'exigence est retirée.\n"
"\n"
"Téléversez l'entente sur la marque (Configuration › Marques), ou choisissez une marque qui en porte une."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_send_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"\"%(tmpl)s\" requires an NDA: identification by mobile is removed, since a "
"signer must have an email address."
msgstr ""
"« %(tmpl)s » exige une entente : l'identification par mobile est retirée, un"
" signataire sans adresse courriel n'existant pas."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_send_wizard.py:0
msgid "\"%s\" has no NDA uploaded: there is nothing to sign."
msgstr ""
"« %s » n'a aucune entente de confidentialité téléversée : il n'y a rien à "
"faire signer."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_transfer_brand.py:0
msgid ""
"\"%s\" requires an NDA, but no document is uploaded: visitors would be stuck"
" in front of an NDA that does not exist."
msgstr ""
"« %s » exige une entente de confidentialité, mais aucun document n'est "
"téléversé : les visiteurs resteraient bloqués devant une entente "
"inexistante."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_send_wizard.py:0
msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(aucune)"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_transfer_audience.py:0
msgid "(not sealed)"
msgstr "(non scellée)"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid "(the identity you just confirmed with your code)."
msgstr ""
"— l'identité que vous\n"
"                                venez de confirmer par code."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid "<span class=\"st-gate-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📜</span>"
msgstr "<span class=\"st-gate-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">📜</span>"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.sign_done_return
msgid "Access the content"
msgstr "Accéder au contenu"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_send_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"An NDA cannot be signed by a visitor identified only by their mobile (a "
"signature requires an email address). Uncheck \"Offer the code by SMS\", or "
"do not require an NDA."
msgstr ""
"Une entente de confidentialité ne peut pas être signée par un visiteur "
"identifié seulement par son mobile (une signature exige une adresse "
"courriel). Décochez « Offrir le code par SMS », ou n'exigez pas d'entente."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer__recipient_otp_status
msgid "Code du destinataire"
msgstr "Code du destinataire"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_brand__nda_consent_text
msgid "Consent text"
msgstr "Texte de consentement"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_securetransfer_sign.selection__secure_transfer_audience__nda_state__refused
msgid "Declined"
msgstr "Refusée"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_brand__nda_required
msgid ""
"Default value for new transfers of this brand. Each sending can keep it or "
"drop it."
msgstr ""
"Valeur par défaut des nouveaux transferts de cette marque. Chaque envoi peut"
" la retenir ou l'écarter."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_send_wizard__nda_required
msgid ""
"Each recipient will sign the NDA in their own name, after confirming their "
"identity with a code and before seeing the content."
msgstr ""
"Chaque destinataire signera l'entente à son nom, après avoir confirmé son "
"identité par code et avant de voir le contenu."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.brand_form_nda
msgid ""
"Each visitor signs THEIR own NDA, under the identity they just confirmed "
"with a code. The signed document and its certificate are filed in the "
"transfer's thread. <br/> <strong>Note:</strong> an NDA removes "
"identification by mobile, since a signer must have an email address."
msgstr ""
"Chaque visiteur signe SA propre entente, à l'identité qu'il\n"
"                        vient de confirmer par code. Le document signé et son\n"
"                        certificat sont versés au fil du transfert.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        <strong>À noter :</strong> une entente retire l'identification\n"
"                        par mobile — un signataire sans adresse courriel n'existe pas."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_template__nda_required
msgid ""
"Each visitor will sign the NDA in their own name, after confirming their "
"identity with a code and before seeing the content. The NDA itself comes "
"from the brand."
msgstr ""
"Chaque visiteur signera l'entente à son nom, après avoir confirmé son "
"identité par code et avant de voir le contenu. L'entente elle-même vient de "
"la marque."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.brand_form_nda
msgid "Empty = bf_sign default consent text."
msgstr "Vide = texte de consentement par défaut de bf_sign."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer__nda_document
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.secure_transfer_form_nda
msgid "Empty = the brand's NDA."
msgstr "Vide = l'entente de la marque."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. modules: bf_attachment_version, bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer__nda_filename
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_brand__nda_filename
msgid "File name"
msgstr "Nom du fichier"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid ""
"Go back to the code step: your identity must be confirmed before the "
"agreement can be drawn up in your name."
msgstr ""
"Reprenez à l'étape du code :\n"
"                                votre identité doit être confirmée avant que\n"
"                                l'entente puisse être établie à votre nom."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid ""
"If this was a mistake, contact the person who sent you this link: they can "
"prepare a new one for you."
msgstr ""
"Si c'était une erreur,\n"
"                                communiquez avec la personne qui vous a transmis ce\n"
"                                lien : elle peut vous en préparer un nouveau."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid "It will be signed in the name of"
msgstr "Elle sera signée au nom de"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_audience__nda_state
msgid "NDA"
msgstr "Entente"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer__nda_document
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_brand__nda_document
msgid "NDA (PDF)"
msgstr "Entente (PDF)"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer__nda_required
msgid "NDA required"
msgstr "Entente de confidentialité exigée"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_transfer_audience.py:0
msgid "NDA signed by %(who)s (request %(ref)s)."
msgstr "Entente de confidentialité signée par %(who)s (demande %(ref)s)."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_audience__nda_signed_on
msgid "NDA signed on"
msgstr "Entente signée le"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_transfer_audience.py:0
msgid "NDA signed, SHA-256 fingerprint: %s"
msgstr "Entente de confidentialité signée — empreinte SHA-256 : %s"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_transfer_audience.py:0
msgid "NDA to sign (%s)"
msgstr "Entente de confidentialité à signer (%s)"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_transfer.py:0
msgid "NDA.pdf"
msgstr "Entente de confidentialité.pdf"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_transfer_audience.py:0
msgid "NDA: %s"
msgstr "Entente de confidentialité — %s"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_send_wizard__nda_available
msgid "Nda Available"
msgstr "Entente disponible"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid "Non-disclosure agreement"
msgstr "Entente de confidentialité"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.brand_form_nda
msgid "Non-disclosure agreement (NDA)"
msgstr "Entente de confidentialité (NDA)"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/controllers/main.py:0
msgid "Non-disclosure agreement: %s"
msgstr "Entente de confidentialité : %s"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_securetransfer_sign.selection__secure_transfer_audience__nda_state__none
msgid "None"
msgstr "Aucune"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_brand__nda_field_template_id
msgid ""
"Position of the signature fields on the NDA. Optional: without a template, "
"the signature is valid and certified, but it is not drawn on the document's "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"Position des pavés de signature sur l'entente. Facultatif : sans gabarit, la"
" signature est valide et certifiée, mais elle n'est pas dessinée sur les "
"pages du document."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid "Powered by"
msgstr "Propulsé par"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_send_wizard.py:0
msgid "Preset partly applied"
msgstr "Préréglage appliqué en partie"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid "Read and sign the agreement"
msgstr "Lire et signer l'entente"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_brand__nda_required
msgid "Require an NDA"
msgstr "Exiger une entente de confidentialité"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_template__nda_required
msgid "Require an NDA signature"
msgstr "Exiger la signature d'une entente"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_send_wizard__nda_required
msgid "Require signing an NDA"
msgstr "Exiger la signature d'une entente de confidentialité"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_securetransfer_sign.selection__secure_transfer__recipient_otp_status__nda
msgid "Required: NDA to sign"
msgstr "Exigé — entente à signer"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_brand__nda_consent_text
msgid ""
"Sentence the signer checks before signing. Empty = the bf_sign default text."
msgstr ""
"Phrase que le signataire coche avant de signer. Vide = le texte par défaut "
"de bf_sign."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer__nda_field_template_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_brand__nda_field_template_id
msgid "Signature field template"
msgstr "Gabarit de pavés"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_securetransfer_sign.selection__secure_transfer_audience__nda_state__signed
msgid "Signed"
msgstr "Signée"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_audience__nda_request_id
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.secure_transfer_audience_search_nda
msgid "Signed NDA"
msgstr "Entente signée"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer__nda_signed_count
msgid "Signed NDAs"
msgstr "Ententes signées"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid "Start over"
msgstr "Recommencer"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid ""
"The agreement could not be prepared. Try again in a moment; if the problem "
"persists, let the sender know."
msgstr ""
"L'entente n'a pas pu être préparée. Réessayez dans un\n"
"                                instant ; si le problème persiste, prévenez l'expéditeur."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.sign_done_return
msgid ""
"The agreement is signed: you can now access the content that was sent to "
"you."
msgstr ""
"L'entente est signée : vous pouvez maintenant accéder au contenu\n"
"                    qui vous a été transmis."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid ""
"The content of this transfer is confidential. Before accessing it, you must "
"sign the agreement below."
msgstr ""
"Le contenu de ce transfert est confidentiel. Avant d'y\n"
"                                accéder, vous devez signer l'entente ci-dessous."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer_brand__nda_document
msgid ""
"The document each visitor must sign before accessing the content. A separate"
" signature request is created for each of them, in their name."
msgstr ""
"Le document que chaque visiteur devra signer avant d'accéder au contenu. Une"
" demande de signature distincte est créée pour chacun, à son nom."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid ""
"The signature is electronic and timestamped. You will receive the signed "
"document and its certificate."
msgstr ""
"La signature est électronique et\n"
"                                horodatée. Vous recevrez le document signé et son\n"
"                                certificat."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_securetransfer_sign.field_secure_transfer__nda_required
msgid ""
"The visitor must sign the NDA before the message and files are shown. A "
"separate signature request is created for each person, under their confirmed"
" identity."
msgstr ""
"Le visiteur devra signer l'entente avant que le message et les fichiers lui "
"soient montrés. Une demande de signature distincte est créée pour chaque "
"personne, à son identité confirmée."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_securetransfer_sign/models/secure_transfer.py:0
msgid ""
"This transfer requires an NDA, but no document is available, neither on the "
"transfer nor on the \"%s\" brand. Visitors would be stuck."
msgstr ""
"Ce transfert exige une entente de confidentialité, mais aucun document n'est"
" disponible — ni sur le transfert, ni sur la marque « %s ». Les visiteurs "
"resteraient bloqués."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_securetransfer_sign.selection__secure_transfer_audience__nda_state__pending
msgid "To sign"
msgstr "À signer"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.secure_transfer_audience_search_nda
msgid "Unsigned NDA"
msgstr "Entente non signée"

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.brand_form_nda
msgid ""
"Without a template, the signature stays valid and certified, but it is not "
"drawn on the document's pages."
msgstr ""
"Sans gabarit, la signature reste valide et certifiée, mais elle n'est pas "
"dessinée sur les pages du document."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid "You declined this agreement. Access to the content stays closed."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez décliné cette entente. L'accès au contenu\n"
"                                reste fermé."

#. module: bf_securetransfer_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_securetransfer_sign.page_nda
msgid ""
"Your session no longer carries a confirmed identity: it may have expired, or"
" you switched browsers."
msgstr ""
"Votre session ne porte plus d'identité confirmée —\n"
"                                elle a peut-être expiré, ou vous avez changé de\n"
"                                navigateur."
